    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "지옥살이",
        "summary": "쓰레쉬는 근처에서 처치된 적의 영혼을 포획해 방어력과 주문력을 영구적으로 올릴 수 있습니다.",
        "tooltip": "쓰레쉬가 처치된 적 근처로 지나가면 적의 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">영혼</span>을 흡수합니다. 흡수된 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">영혼</span>은 영구적으로 쓰레쉬의 방어력을 <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">1</span>, 주문력을 <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">1</span>만큼 올려줍니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Damnation",
        "summary": "Thresh can harvest the souls of enemies that die near him, permanently granting him Armor and Ability Power.",
        "tooltip": "Thresh collects the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Souls</span> of dead enemies by walking near them. Each <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Soul</span> grants him <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">1 Armor</span> and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">1 Ability Power</span>."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "地狱诅咒",
        "summary": "锤石可以收割那些死在他身边的敌人们的灵魂，从而为他提供护甲和法术强度。",
        "tooltip": "锤石在走过已死敌人身边的时候，会收集他们的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">灵魂</span>。每个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">灵魂</span>为他提供<span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">1护甲</span>和<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">1法术强度</span>。"
      }
    }
  }
